IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. BANK.

DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.

01 WS-ACCOUNT-NO PIC 9(8) VALUE 12345678.
01 WS-BALANCE    PIC 9(7) VALUE 25000.
01 WS-AMOUNT     PIC 9(6) VALUE 5000.
01 WS-TRANS-TYPE PIC X VALUE "W".

PROCEDURE DIVISION.

    DISPLAY "ACCOUNT NUMBER: " WS-ACCOUNT-NO
    DISPLAY "INITIAL BALANCE: " WS-BALANCE

    IF WS-TRANS-TYPE = "D"

        ADD WS-AMOUNT TO WS-BALANCE

        DISPLAY "AMOUNT DEPOSITED"

    ELSE
        IF WS-TRANS-TYPE = "W"

            IF WS-AMOUNT <= WS-BALANCE

                SUBTRACT WS-AMOUNT FROM WS-BALANCE

                DISPLAY "WITHDRAWAL SUCCESSFUL"

            ELSE

                DISPLAY "INSUFFICIENT BALANCE"

            END-IF

        ELSE

            DISPLAY "INVALID TRANSACTION TYPE"

        END-IF
    END-IF

    DISPLAY "FINAL BALANCE: " WS-BALANCE

    STOP RUN.